-- ==============================================================================
-- Migration 050: Political Entity Model (W018)
-- Target: Staging Supabase (fkpigozcqnmcvofuksar)
-- Authoritative Plan: PLAN-W018-REV-1.0.md
--
-- Security Baseline:
--   1. 100% SECURITY INVOKER for all stored functions (prosecdef = false).
